# UniWorld - Project Roadmap

Source of truth for scope and phases: `_development/docs/UniWorld_PROJECT.md`. This roadmap is a checklisted guide for iterative development. Tick items as they are completed.

## Repo and Development Layout

- **`_development/`**: Development-only content; not included in the final published package.
  - **`_development/dev_notes/`**: Create and keep all dev notes here. Create or update dev notes **before** starting development work each session.
  - **`_development/docs/`**: Working and source docs (e.g. UniWorld_PROJECT.md).
  - **`_development/scripts/`**: Auxiliary scripts; not shipped.
- **`tests/`** (at repo root): Tests are part of the repo and published source.
- **`docs/`** (at repo root): Published documentation (README, integration guides, contributing). Generate per steps below.
- **`.gitignore`**: Observe when adding or generating files; keep dev artifacts and generated content in the correct places so ignore rules stay consistent.

